msgid "Use"
msgstr "Gebruiken"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7789
#, c-format
msgid "What %s sends"
msgstr "Wat %s stuurt"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7807
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr "De gewone manier voor oudere games zoals deze, met hun 2D en 3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7808
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, with OpenGL ready in case the game asks for "
"it. Leave it here unless the game won't start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7809
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Het snelst, en wat de meeste games willen. Laat het zo, tenzij de game "
"niet start of het beeld niet klopt."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7811
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, without OpenGL. For a game that starts or "
"draws worse with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7813
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Een andere manier om de game te tekenen, trager dan Auto. Probeer het als "
"de game niet start of het beeld niet klopt."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7815
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Tekent alles in 2D, zoals gewone Windows-programma's worden getekend. Voor "
"een 2D-game die flikkert of maar een deel van zijn scherm toont; een game "
"met 3D-scènes start er niet mee."

