"the USB drive). Install them now? A game installed from there is moved "
"into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL folder."
msgstr ""
"Er wachten %d games in de INSTALL-mappen van PC5 (die van PC5 zelf, en "
"PC5/INSTALL op de USB-schijf). Nu installeren? Een game die daaruit wordt "
"geïnstalleerd, wordt naar de bibliotheek van PC5 verplaatst, uit de "
"INSTALL-map."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:9280
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install it now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
